templates/nature-latex.latex
  Derived from Pandoc's own default LaTeX template (`pandoc
  --print-default-template=latex`) with its six partials inlined, then adapted to
  the sn-jnl document class.
  Copyright (c) 2006-present, John MacFarlane and Pandoc contributors.
  The file header carries the derivation notice and lists every change.

templates/cover_letter.latex, templates/cover_letter_template.latex
  Built on the moderncv LaTeX class (LPPL). moderncv itself is not vendored here —
  it is provided by the user's TeX distribution.

filters/latex-div.lua
  Converts Pandoc native Divs (carrying a `latex`/`data-latex` attribute) into
  LaTeX environments (\begin{env}…\end{env}).
  Author: Romain Lesur, Christophe Dervieux, Atsushi Yasumoto, Yihui Xie (R Markdown).
  License: Public Domain.
  Note: it loads R Markdown's shared.lua via the RMARKDOWN_LUA_SHARED env var, which
  is not set in the PaperBell runtime, so no recipe currently references it. Kept for
  reference / future adaptation.

